# Quantitative worker runtime dependencies.
#
# These MUST stay in lockstep with the direct dependency versions pinned in
# pyproject.toml's [project.dependencies] -- that pin is what the committed
# reports under reports/ were generated against, and drifting it here would be
# a silent statistical change. Bump both together, never one alone.
#
# Deliberately excludes streamlit/plotly/pyarrow (the interactive lab's `app`
# extra): the worker never renders a UI, so those ~300MB of transitive
# dependencies do not belong in the execution image that Phase 2 builds from
# this lock (architecture plan Section 11.3, "slim the image").
